{
 "chunk": 27,
 "cat": "jar",
 "items": [
  {
   "i": 1,
   "en": "Not anything that weren't a weapon, I mean.\"",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "en": "Offer to apologize for the misunderstanding by buying ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "en": "Rumours flew among the crew, who were told nothing, as the fleet suddenly left a rich ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "en": "The loot was good, and any brigand they couldn't fight, they could flee.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "en": "The old space-hand opens up as one drink turns to two or three. ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "en": "The old spacer tells you that ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "en": "The spacer explains that just ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "en": "There they found a planet all shining and red. \"It weren't anything natural. It was all... shapes, angles, glowing like plasma. That's truth,\" ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "en": "They fared two hyperspace storms before arriving at a distant star system.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "en": "You consider a trip to ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "en": "You emphasize your interest in the subject by having the spacer's drink refreshed. ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "en": "a salvage fleet trawling decivilized systems outside the Core Worlds. ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "en": "asteroid belt to make for the outer system jump-point. ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "en": "attacked with no mercy. \"It weren't pirates, nor military,\" here the spacer loses ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "en": "belying advanced tech. They had equally advanced weapons, too, and with those they ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "en": "escape pod which was only \"mostly\" malfunctioning. \"The miracle wasn't that I ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 17,
   "en": "fixed it, it's that they could thaw enough of me out at the end of it for me to keep ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 18,
   "en": "has fallen asleep in ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 19,
   "en": "in semi-retirement ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 20,
   "en": "livin', if you call this livin'.\"",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 21,
   "en": "never seen anything Domain-made glow like that across a whole planet's face. ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 22,
   "en": "stride as ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 23,
   "en": "this mysterious planet with its unknown technology. You also realize that the old spacer ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 24,
   "en": "to the emergency cryo-pods. Like a bit o' their brain is still froze up and not coming back.\"",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 25,
   "en": "An old spacer told you a tale about a mysterious red planet. The pilot - the only other survivor of the salvage expedition - may know the planet's location.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 26,
   "en": "Explore the planet",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 27,
   "en": "Red Planet",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 28,
   "en": "Red Planet - Completed",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 29,
   "en": "Talk to the pilot at %s",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 30,
   "en": "You've found the planet and uncovered its secret.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 31,
   "en": "You've talked to the old spacer's pilot comrade and convinced them to divulge the location of the planet.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/PlanetaryShieldIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 32,
   "en": " drink and ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 33,
   "en": " growls, knocking back the rest of ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 34,
   "en": " instead of %s units of ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 35,
   "en": " on board.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 36,
   "en": " provision request got mixed up and ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 37,
   "en": " smoothes things along with the port authorities and arranges for the quickest cargo ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 38,
   "en": " was shipped %s units of ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 39,
   "en": ", as a favor from you to ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 40,
   "en": ". \"A mining drone with half its Ludd-damned ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 41,
   "en": ". Afterward, the quartermaster ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 42,
   "en": "Approach the quartermaster and offer to buy ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 43,
   "en": "Do nothing but commiserate with the quartermaster as you finish your drink.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 44,
   "en": "In venerated tradition going back thousands of cycles, the quartermaster vents to you about how ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 45,
   "en": "None other than the station's quartermaster, who looks rather sullen, is sitting at the bar.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 46,
   "en": "Offer to swap ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 47,
   "en": "You drink to the bureaucrats in Fleet Supply \"mistaking the airlock for the head-hatch\", empty your glass, and make your exit.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 48,
   "en": "You exchange comms with the quartermaster and the very next day ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 49,
   "en": "computer fried on rads would do a better job than the idiots in Fleet Supply,\" ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 50,
   "en": "sends you a personal thank-you note.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 51,
   "en": "slamming the glass down.\n\n",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 52,
   "en": "transfer you've ever seen, trading your %s ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/QuartermasterCargoSwapBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 53,
   "en": " cries again and again, ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 54,
   "en": " glowing TriPad.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 55,
   "en": " greasy TriPad. \"There’s an enormous stock of ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 56,
   "en": " in academic uniform is bothering some of the ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 57,
   "en": " pitch through to the end.\n\n",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 58,
   "en": " proposal and walk away",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 59,
   "en": " story. ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 60,
   "en": " turns out to be a scientist, maybe a \"scientist\", ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 61,
   "en": " voice drops to a whisper, ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 62,
   "en": " was a bit unhinged, after all - ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 63,
   "en": "\"The data doesn’t lie!\" ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 64,
   "en": "\"you retrieve for me the AI core hidden in the midst of the trove. ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 65,
   "en": "A disheveled ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 66,
   "en": "Accept and promise to ship the AI core to the given address in a specially shielded crate",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 67,
   "en": "All I ask is,\" ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 68,
   "en": "Decline ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 69,
   "en": "Flag down the academic with the TriPad",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 70,
   "en": "That, I get to keep. I’ll tell you exactly where to look if you agree to my terms.\"",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 71,
   "en": "Unfortunately, a closer analysis of the data brings to light several glaring inconsistencies. Looks like ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 72,
   "en": "You hear the scientist's offended, quavering voice at your back, \"The truth is out there! I won't be held back by small-minds like all of you!\" Most of the other patrons pretend extreme interest in their drinks, though at least one looses a mocking laugh.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 73,
   "en": "You set your face to a practiced stern-but-receptive look as ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 74,
   "en": "and is delighted to have someone finally listen to ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 75,
   "en": "better-dressed spacers with ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 76,
   "en": "on ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 77,
   "en": "there's nothing here worth investigating.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 78,
   "en": "though you can’t make sense of the arcane tables scrolling ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 79,
   "en": "unrecovered Domain-era technology in this system. No one else can see it! ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 80,
   "en": "you hear ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 81,
   "en": " as soon as you're back ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 82,
   "en": " services.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 83,
   "en": " was no-one important.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 84,
   "en": "Technology Cache",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 85,
   "en": "Technology Cache - Looted",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 86,
   "en": "The scientist that informed you of this wants the Alpha Core from this cache as payment for ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 87,
   "en": "You've found and looted the cache of pre-Collapse technology in the ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 88,
   "en": "You've kept your promise to the scientist and placed the AI core in a secure container, to be shipped to ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 89,
   "en": "You've learned that there is a cache of pre-Collapse technology to be found in the ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 90,
   "en": "You've taken the AI core promised to the scientist for yourself. Surely, ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 91,
   "en": "in civilized space.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/ScientistAICoreIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 92,
   "en": "The loan amount is %s.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent$1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 93,
   "en": "You're able to negotiate the repayment amount from %s down to %s.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent$1.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 94,
   "en": " By the time it is agreed that a substantially lower repayment figure will benefit all parties, the dazed ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 95,
   "en": " and try to land some investment credits",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 96,
   "en": " brusquely orders a replacement.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 97,
   "en": " drink has gone flat. ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 98,
   "en": " eyes tracking rapidly, navigating some ocular data interface as you speak; ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 99,
   "en": " loan from Tri-Tachyon investor",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 100,
   "en": " mimics a stricken look, \"I'll ruin your reputation across Tri-Tachyon space. What do you say?\"",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 101,
   "en": " pitch to modify the proposed terms. You notice ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 102,
   "en": " quickly cuts to the point, and says \"I'm simply in the business of statistics, and ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 103,
   "en": " seems thrown off-balance by your savvy, and never quite recovers that signature megacorp implacability.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 104,
   "en": "%s back to me in, oh, %s days. If not, \"",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 105,
   "en": "'s smile freezes in place as you launch into a sophisticated ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 106,
   "en": "A Tri-Tachyon careerist sits at a spotless table, sipping something expensive-looking.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 107,
   "en": "A young Tri-Tachyon factioneer in a perfect suit sips from some insubstantial drink as sophisticated as it is expensive. After introductions ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 108,
   "en": "Accept the deal and order another round to celebrate",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 109,
   "en": "Decline the deal, explaining that you're \"just here to network\"",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 110,
   "en": "I like your growth potential. I think that you can take my %s now and pay ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 111,
   "en": "Introduce yourself to the Tri-Tachyon ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 112,
   "en": "Negotiate a lower rate on the loan",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 113,
   "en": "Negotiated lower rate on ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 114,
   "en": "The Tri-Tachyon ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 115,
   "en": "You leave the lounge rich in credits, having exchanged secure comm keys with the Tri-Tachyon shark and receiving the transfer immediately. Your head spins with plans for how to leverage your new assets - and a bit from the drink, you admit to yourself.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 116,
   "en": "investor finds ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 117,
   "en": " and must repay it on time, ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 118,
   "en": " on time.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 119,
   "en": " will be ruined.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 120,
   "en": "%s original loan amount",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 121,
   "en": "%s owed",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 122,
   "en": "Loan Repaid",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 123,
   "en": "Loan Repayment",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 124,
   "en": "Loan Repayment - Due Soon",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 125,
   "en": "Loan Repayment - Failed",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 126,
   "en": "You should be able to find ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 127,
   "en": "You've accepted a loan from ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 128,
   "en": "You've failed to repay the loan from ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 129,
   "en": "You've repaid the loan from ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 130,
   "en": "left to repay",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 131,
   "en": "or your reputation with ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachLoanIntel.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 132,
   "en": " TriPad. An untouched drink sits on the immaculate table.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 133,
   "en": " appraises you coolly as ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 134,
   "en": " booth. ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 135,
   "en": " concludes, \"I'd like to see ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 136,
   "en": " fills a glass from a bottle that looks to cost more than many starships.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 137,
   "en": " fingertips. ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 138,
   "en": " glass between ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 139,
   "en": " leans back, rolling the stem of ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 140,
   "en": " lists detailed specifications ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 141,
   "en": " says. ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 142,
   "en": " says. \"I find that reassuring.\"",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 143,
   "en": " smiles, \"So let's talk about you.\" As ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 144,
   "en": "\"I enjoy the idea of owning a small part of history.\" ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 145,
   "en": "\"The vintage predates the Collapse, you know,\" ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 146,
   "en": "\"You didn't accept my initial offer\", ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 147,
   "en": "A Tri-Tachyon executive sits in a private booth, scrolling through ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 148,
   "en": "Accept the deal and toast your joint venture",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 149,
   "en": "An impeccable Tri-Tachyon factioneer of completely indeterminate age has you invited to ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 150,
   "en": "As the negotiations conclude, the Tri-Tachyon ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 151,
   "en": "It's a lot of money. You also consider that this Tri-Tach suit paid too much for the bottle.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 152,
   "en": "Throw some credits around like a big spender, to see if you can attract the executive's attention",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 153,
   "en": "To incentivize the ruthless enterprise I so admire, let us say you would repay %s ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 154,
   "en": "You take this in as you sip your drink. ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 155,
   "en": "and statistical trends regarding your career in the Persean Sector you make a mental ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 156,
   "en": "information security. \"So,\" ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 157,
   "en": "note to have a discussion with your senior officers on the subject of ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 158,
   "en": "what you could accomplish with a short-term capital infusion of let us say %s. ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 159,
   "en": "within %s days.\n\n",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/TriTachMajorLoanBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 160,
   "en": ", has given you information about ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/BaseHistorianOfferWithLocation.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 161,
   "en": "A full survey will need to be run before the ruins can be explored.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/BaseHistorianOfferWithLocation.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 162,
   "en": "The historian, ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/BaseHistorianOfferWithLocation.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 163,
   "en": "The item inside a ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/BaseHistorianOfferWithLocation.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 164,
   "en": "The item is in the ruins found on a ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/BaseHistorianOfferWithLocation.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 165,
   "en": "The item is inside ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/BaseHistorianOfferWithLocation.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 166,
   "en": "You have recovered this item.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/BaseHistorianOfferWithLocation.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 167,
   "en": "the location of a valuable item.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/BaseHistorianOfferWithLocation.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 168,
   "en": " donation would let ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/DonationOffer.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 169,
   "en": " pursue",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/DonationOffer.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 170,
   "en": "... some promising leads that a ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/DonationOffer.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 171,
   "en": "Make the donation",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/DonationOffer.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 172,
   "en": "Steer the conversation to other topics",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/DonationOffer.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 173,
   "en": "The asked-for donation amount is %s. You have %s available.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/DonationOffer.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 174,
   "en": "The asked-for donation amount is %s. You only have %s available.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/DonationOffer.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 175,
   "en": "The historian cooperates in changing topics.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/DonationOffer.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 176,
   "en": "The historian thanks you for your help.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/DonationOffer.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 177,
   "en": " Blueprint - Recovered",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/FighterBlueprintOffer.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 178,
   "en": " Blueprint Location",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/FighterBlueprintOffer.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 179,
   "en": " blueprint",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/FighterBlueprintOffer.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 180,
   "en": "... the possible location of a blueprint (",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/FighterBlueprintOffer.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 181,
   "en": "Learned location of ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/FighterBlueprintOffer.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 182,
   "en": "Weapon Blueprint",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/FighterBlueprintOffer.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 183,
   "en": " face at this.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 184,
   "en": " leans back, looking pleased.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 185,
   "en": " leans in as if conspiring, \"",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 186,
   "en": " looks up and offers the seat across from ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 187,
   "en": " resumes an energetic demeanor.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 188,
   "en": " says. \"In my line of work, even I don't ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 189,
   "en": " sits alone at a table, ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 190,
   "en": " taps the book, ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 191,
   "en": " the information and get up to leave.",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 192,
   "en": " wants",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 193,
   "en": " with the paper book and see what ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 194,
   "en": "\"And you have the means.\"",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 195,
   "en": "\"Do you have anything for me now?\"",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 196,
   "en": "\"However, if you did find my information valuable, I would gladly accept... donations. Think of it as patronage to fuel my research, which in turn could produce valuable leads. Or it might help to think of it as an investment, but with no obligations incurred by either party. Consider it- you could enrich your own enterprises while contributing to the sum of human knowledge!\"",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 197,
   "en": "\"I am what you might call a historian-adventurer; a rogue archaelogist uncovering the history of the Sector despite the danger of this exceptional era. In the course of my studies I often chance upon hints about where certain pieces of technology might be found. Retrieving those artifacts is, naturally, your role in our arrangement. ... Only if you're interested, of course - but I've done my research on your exploits and I'm sure that you will be interested.\"\n\nSpeech complete, ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 198,
   "en": "\"I expect you'll be wanting to get paid for this information?\"",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 199,
   "en": "\"I understand why you would assume that; this is a mercenary age. But no, nothing quite so transactional. History is an uncertain trade, and such an approach would lead to expectations, disappointment, and recrimination. All of which I'm eager to avoid, especially the last.\" An additional wrinkle forms on ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 200,
   "en": "\"See you again soon, somewhere!\" ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
  {
   "i": 201,
   "en": "\"So good to see you again, ",
   "ctx": "starfarer.api.jar:com/fs/starfarer/api/impl/campaign/intel/bar/events/historian/HistorianBarEvent.class"
  },
